(7685132, 1258258, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love that long shadow and the bit of steam coming out of the cup. Very nicely composed and lit to make for a very interesting cup of coffee.</td>', 'Love that long shadow and the bit of steam coming out of the cup. Very nicely composed and lit to make for a very interesting cup of coffee.', '2021-01-22 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
